  "goodToKnow": "Die Tapete is wallpaper: Tapeten kleben, tapezieren (to wallpaper). Many German rentals have Raufasertapete, white woodchip paper that tenants paint over, and they often must restore it when moving out (Schönheitsreparaturen). Ein Tapetenwechsel is a change of scene: Ich brauche einen Tapetenwechsel. Plural: die Tapeten."
